:: Pregnancy Birth Wolf Rescue
<<location "forest">><<effects>>
움직임이 멈춘다. 당신의 몸이 부드러운 것 위로 내려지는 것이 느껴진다.
<br><br>
<<if $syndromewolves is 1>>
	이 냄새를 기억한다. 당신은 늑대 동굴 안에 있다.
<<else>>
	당신은 동굴 안에 있다. 적어도 피할 곳은 된다.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[다음 (0:15)|Pregnancy Birth Wolf Cave 1]]>><<pass 15>><<endevent>><<set $phase to 3>><</link>>

:: Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop Rescue
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "forest_shop_garden">><<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<npc Gwylan>><<person1>>
<<if $gwylanSeen.includes("garden")>>
	그윌란의 정원에서 깨어난다. <<He>>【은는】 허둥지둥 돌아다니며 물건들을 모아 근처에 둔다.
<<else>>
	장미 향기를 맡으며 깨어난다.
	<br><br>

	네모난 돌 타일이 땅을 따라 넓게 펼쳐져 있고, 잔디밭과 흙, 꽃, 허브로 채워진 돋운 흙더미들을 잇고 있다.
	그 주위는 2미터가 훌쩍 넘는 높이의 나무 말뚝들이 인상적으로 엮여 둘러싸고 있다. 덩굴이 틈새를 비집고 올라올 수 있을 정도의 간격만 있어, 외부의 엿보는 시선으로부터 이 구역 전체를 가려준다.
	<br><br>

	당신은 나무 지붕으로 덮인 다른 돋운 구역 안에 있다.
	<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain" or Weather.precipitation is "snow">>
		<<print Weather.precipitation is "rain" ? "비" : "눈">>의 영향을 받지 않는 곳으로,
	<</if>>
	안쪽은 다양한 쿠션과 누비이불로 채워져 있다.
	<br><br>

	익숙한 목소리가 흥얼거리는 소리가 들린다. 그윌란이다. <<He>>【은는】 허둥지둥 돌아다니며 물건들을 모아 근처에 둔다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

당신이 깨어난 것을 보자 <<he>>【은는】 미소를 지으며 무릎을 꿇는다. "여기 있어, 숨 쉬는 거 잊지 마. 괜찮을 거야. 약속해." <<He>>【은는】 당신의 손을 잡고 꽉 쥔 뒤 다시 달려간다. <<takeHandholdingVirginity "Gwylan" "consensual">>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop
/* Forest shop birth (human). Gwylan delivers with herbs. 3-4 = the birth.
   Shares prose with the hospital chain via pregnancy-widgets.twee. */
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "forest_shop_garden">><<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set $first_birth to !$pregnancyStats.humanToysUnlocked>>
<<npc Gwylan>><<person1>>
<<setKnowsAboutPregnancy "pc" "Gwylan">>

최대한 침착하려 애쓰지만, 공황 상태에 빠지기 시작한다.
<<if $gwylanSeen.includes("beast_ritual")>>
	그윌란이 서툴다는 건 알지만, <<he>>【은는】 항상 자기가 뭘 하는지 아는 것 같다.
<<else>>
	그윌란이 정말 이걸 어떻게 하는지 알긴 하는 걸까?
<</if>>
<<he>>【이가】 베개, 수건 더미와 허브가 가득 담긴 바구니를 들고 돌아오자 당신의 공포심은 사그라든다. "자, 이쪽으로 앞으로 와." <<He>>【은는】 재빨리 베개와 수건으로 당신을 위한 둥지를 만든다. 분명 편안하겠지만, 당신은 지금 얼마나 아픈지에 대해서만 생각할 수 있다.
<br><br>

"아- 해봐." <<He>>【은는】 당신의 입에 허브를 집어넣는다. "이게 진통을 더..." <<he>>【은는】 <<his>> 손목을 돌린다. "부드럽게 해줄 거야. 아기가... 어이! 숨 쉬어! 아기가 더 쉽게 나올 거야. 아! 진통에 쓸 만한 걸 찾아줄게!" 당신은 그윌란이 이 상황에 거의 신이 난 것처럼 들린다는 걸 알아차리지 않을 수 없다.
<br><br>

<<He>>【은는】 <<his>> 바구니를 뒤져 허브를 하나씩 살피다가, 만족스러운 숨을 내쉬며 <<himself>>에게 고개를 끄덕인다. "이거면 되겠어. 자, 그거 뱉어." <<He>>【은는】 <<his>> 손을 내민다.
<br><br>

<<link [[뱉는다|Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 2]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<stress 24>><</link>><<ggstress>>
<br>
<<link [[삼킨다|Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 2]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>
<br>

:: Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 2
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	당신은 그윌란의 손에 그것을 뱉는다. <<He>>【은는】 전혀 개의치 않는 듯, 그저 다음 것을 당신의 입에 집어넣는다.
<<else>>
	당신은 그것을 삼킨다. 그윌란이 얼굴을 찡그린다. "안 좋은 수였어. 다른 쪽으로 나올 때 기분 안 좋을 텐데." <<He>>【은는】 다음 것을 당신의 입에 집어넣는다.
<</if>>
"씹어. 어금니로."
<br><br>

당신은 씹는다. 따뜻한 맛이 난다. 몸이 이완되기 시작한다. <<pain -8>><<llpain>>
<br><br>

"좋아, 잠깐만 나한테 협조해 줘야겠어." <<He>>【은는】 당신에게 아주 가까이 다가와 엉덩이를 잡는다.
<<outfitChecks>>
<<if !_fullyNaked>>
	<<He>>【은는】 당신의 옷을 벗기기 시작하고, 옷가지 하나하나가 마치 액체처럼 스르르 벗겨진다.
<</if>>
<<if playerChastity()>>
	<<He>>【은는】 당신의 <<print $worn.genitals.name>>【을를】 보고 <<his>> 얼굴을 찌푸린다. "그건 내가 처리할 수 있어." <<He>>【은는】 다시 한번 쏜살같이 달려 나갔다가, 온갖 도구와 유리병을 들고 금방 돌아온다.
	<br><br>

	진짜 끌이라고 생각되는 도구로 한참 동안 쪼아낸 끝에, 마침내 그것이 부서진다.
	<<set $worn.genitals.type.push("broken")>><<genitalsruined>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<He>>【은는】 장갑과 의료용 마스크를 착용하고, 물이 가득 담긴 양동이를 옆으로 밀어 놓는다. <<He>>【은는】 수건 몇 장을 물에 담가 하나는 당신의 이마에 올려놓고, 다른 하나로는 당신을 닦아주기 시작한다. 당신은 <<hes>> 일하는 속도에 깜짝 놀란다.
<<wash>><<undress "forest_shop_birth">>
<br><br>

<<link [[그윌란에게 병원에 데려다 달라고 부탁한다|Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 3]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[그윌란에게 자기가 하는 일을 알고 있는지 묻는다|Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 3]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>
<br>

:: Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 3
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<switch $speech_attitude>>
		<<case "meek">>"Shouldn't I be seeing a doctor?!" You ask.
		<<case "bratty">>"Gwylan, please call an ambulance. Or the police. Anyone that will get me to the hospital."
		<<default>>"Gwylan, why aren't you taking me to the hospital?"
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>

	<<He>> doesn't stop. "Not a chance. You don't need the hospital." <<He>> looks up at you, <<his>> gaze intense. "This isn't my first delivery, dear. Trust me." <<His>> tone is suddenly much different.
<<else>>
	<<switch $speech_attitude>>
		<<case "meek">>"You look like you know what you're doing," you say between strained breaths.
		<<case "bratty">>"You seem excited. Should I be worried? Have you done this before?" you ask between strained breaths.
		<<default>>"This doesn't look like your first time doing this," you say between strained breaths.
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>

	<<He>> looks up at you, <<his>> gaze intense. "This isn't my first delivery, dear. Trust me." <<His>> tone is suddenly much different.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<He>> grabs a long lighter and ignites an incense burner hanging nearby. <<He>> starts to hum
<<if $seabird_lullaby gte 2>>
	<span class="teal">Seabird's Lullaby</span>.
<<else>>
	some <span class="teal">faintly familiar</span> tune.
<</if>>
<br><br>

You suddenly feel tired. More tired than you've ever felt before. As the pain fades, you find yourself sinking into the pillows and quilts around you. You feel your consciousness fade.
<br><br>

<<set _timeCalc to birthLaborTime()>>

/* Note: Pregnancy species */
<<switch playerNormalPregnancyType()>>
	<<case "human">>
		<<setKnowsAboutPregnancy "pc" "Bailey">>
		Gwylan's voice floats in your dreamless slumber. "Child of the forest, please don't cry.<<if !$player.vaginaExist>> Your birth may be strange, but it makes no difference to I.<</if>>"
	<<case "wolf">>
		Gwylan's voice floats in your dreamless slumber. "Ah, a wild heart, born of our forest! How wonderful. How long has it been..."
<</switch>>
<br><br>

You hear a deep breath. You think it's yours. "Good. Breathe." Gwylan's voice is melodic, almost like singing. "...and push." <<His>> voice drops an entire octave. "Breathe... and push. Breathe... and push."
<br><br>

<<if $dissociation gte 1>>
	<<birthDissociationVision>>
<</if>>

<<switch playerNormalPregnancyType()>>
	<<case "human">>
		<<link [[Next (<<print getTimeString(_timeCalc)>>)|Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 4]]>><<endevent>><<run beginPlayerBirth()>><<pass _timeCalc>><</link>>
	<<case "wolf">>
		<<link [[Next (<<print getTimeString(_timeCalc)>>)|Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop Wolf]]>><<endevent>><<run beginPlayerBirth()>><<pass _timeCalc>><</link>>
<</switch>>

:: Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 4
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "forest_shop_garden">><<effects>>
<<endevent>>
<<npc Gwylan>><<person1>>

<<set $litter_size to getLabouringLitter("pc").length>>
<<set _baby to $litter_size is 1 ? "baby" : "babies">>

You hear that familiar humming again.

<<if $dissociation gte 1>>
	You awaken wrapped up tightly in blankets. Your eyes open slowly. Gwylan stands beside you, holding <<= $litter_size is 3 ? "a trio of" : $litter_size is 2 ? "two" : "a">> bundled _baby in <<his>> arms.
	<br><br>

	"Rise and shine, <<pmummy>>," <<he>> says, passing you the _baby.
	<<birthCradle>>
	<<birthDissociationGlee>>
	<<birthBabySleeps>> <<trauma -100>><<llltrauma>>
<<else>>
	You awaken wrapped up tightly in blankets. Gwylan stands beside you, holding <<= $litter_size is 3 ? "a trio of" : $litter_size is 2 ? "two" : "a">> bundled _baby in <<his>> arms.
	<br><br>

	"Rise and shine, <<pmummy>>," <<he>> says, passing you the _baby.
	<<birthCradle>>
	<<birthBabySleeps>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

"It was a smooth process," <<he>> says. <<He>> looks wistful for a moment, but shakes it off and almost looks giddy seeing you and your <<= _baby is "babies" ? "children" : "child">> together. "Every child needs a name. Have you thought of <<= _baby is "babies" ? "any" : "one">>?"
<br><br>

<<set $bornChildrenIds to []>>
<<run getLabouringLitter("pc").forEach(child => $bornChildrenIds.push(child.childId))>>

<<birthUi "pc" "forest_shop" "home" "Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 5" _time>>

:: Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 5
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<childSelect `getChildrenOf($recentBirthId).last().childId`>>
<<if $litter_size is 1>>
	You cradle your baby for a while longer, enjoying <<childhis>> tiny breaths and movements. <<childHe>> spends most of the time sleeping, but opens <<childhis>> eyes occasionally and gazes into yours.
	<br><br>
	Gwylan rubs your shoulders.
	<<birthAftercareNappy>>
	"If you want to rest," <<he>> starts. "I can take care of <<childhim>> in the meantime. We'll be right here next to you, dear. I can go put on some tea, too."
	<br><br>
	You want nothing more than to hold <<childname>>, but you find yourself dozing all the same.
	<br><br>
<<elseif $litter_size is 2>>
	You cradle your babies for a while longer, enjoying their tiny breaths and movements. They spend most of the time sleeping, but open their eyes occasionally and gaze into yours.
	<br><br>
	Gwylan rubs your shoulders.
	<<birthAftercareNappy>>
	"If you want to rest," <<he>> starts. "I can take care of them in the meantime. We'll be right here next to you, dear. I can go put on some tea, too."
	<br><br>
	You want nothing more than to hold the twins, but you find yourself dozing all the same.
	<br><br>
<<elseif $litter_size is 3>>
	You cradle your babies for a while longer, enjoying their tiny breaths and movements. They spend most of the time sleeping, but open their eyes occasionally and gaze into yours.
	<br><br>
	Gwylan rubs your shoulders.
	<<birthAftercareNappy>>
	"If you want to rest," <<he>> starts. "I can take care of them in the meantime. We'll be right here next to you, dear. I can go put on some tea, too."
	<br><br>
	You want nothing more than to hold the triplets, but you find yourself dozing all the same.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Next|Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 6]]>><<storeon "forest_shop_birth">><<pass 4 hour>><<stress -40>><</link>>
<br><br>

:: Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 6
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
<<effects>>
<<if $litter_size gte 2>><<childrenNames $bornChildrenIds>> lie<<else>><<childname>> lies<</if>> in a hammock as Gwylan helps you stand.
<<if $first_birth or playerNormalPregnancyTotal() is 0>>
	You feel your insides drop as you stand, but <<he>> assures you that's normal.
	<br><br>

	Despite the pain, you feel a lot more comfortable walking than you did before the birth. You'd forgotten how easy it is to move without people inside you.
	<br><br>

	Gwylan helps you dress. "Thank you for trusting me," <<he>> says.
<<elseif between(playerNormalPregnancyTotal(), 1, 2)>>
	You feel your insides drop as you stand. You remember this feeling from your last birth and know it's normal.
	<br><br>

	Despite the pain, you feel a lot more comfortable walking than you did before the birth. You'd forgotten how easy it is to move without people inside you.
	<br><br>

	Gwylan helps you dress. "Thank you for trusting me," <<he>> says.
<<elseif between(playerNormalPregnancyTotal(), 3, 7)>>
	You feel your insides drop as you stand. You're still not used to the feeling.
	<br><br>

	You get walking again quite easily. It's a little awkward, but the transition isn't as bad as it used to be. It's still easier to move around when there isn't another human inside you.
	<br><br>

	Gwylan helps you dress. "Thank you for trusting me," <<he>> says.
<<elseif between(playerNormalPregnancyTotal(), 8, 19)>>
	You stand up without a hitch. There's hardly any difference in feeling anymore, although you do feel much more nimble.
	<br><br>

	<<He>> looks impressed at your mobility, only keeping an arm around you for stability. "Wow, look at you! You're a natural."
	<br><br>

	Gwylan helps you dress. "Thank you for trusting me," <<he>> says.
<<elseif playerNormalPregnancyTotal() gte 20>>
	You stand up without assistance, feeling empty inside. You already miss the feeling of being pregnant.
	<br><br>

	<<He>> giggles. "I have a feeling you're not going to be unladen for long." You throw your clothes back on quickly.
	<br><br>

	"Thank you for trusting me," <<he>> says.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Gwylan shares some tea with you, and the two of you spend some time chatting. <<He>> has a lot to say about the joy of raising children. <<stress -6>><<llstress>>
<br><br>

"I hope you don't mind, but..." <<he>> suddenly falters. "I've already contacted the orphanage caretaker. <<nnpc_He "Bailey">> should be here soon. I know the orphanage isn't the best place, but for newborns... there are far worse places."
<br><br>

<<He>> puts a hand on your shoulder.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 7]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 7
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
<<set $location to "town">><<effects>>

<<npc "Bailey" 1>><<npc "Gwylan" 2>><<person2>>
<<childSelect `getChildrenOf($recentBirthId).last().childId`>>

Gwylan walks with you to the forest shop entrance, just in time for a knock at the door. Gwylan opens it with a smile. Bailey frowns down at <<him>>.
<br><br>

"Why didn't you take <<phim>> to the hospital?" <<person1>><<he>> asks flatly.
<br><br>

Gwylan puts <<person2>><<his>> hands on <<his>> hips and smiles. "I'm better."
<br><br>

"It's not about skill, it's about risk," Bailey says. "You don't have specialised medical equipment here. What if my ward got an infection?"
<br><br>

Gwylan's cheery expression falls. "Your <i>ward</i> is just fine, and so <<if $litter_size gte 2>>are <<pher>> lovely children<<else>>is <<pher>> lovely child<</if>>. I don't know why I expected so much as a 'thank you' from you of all people, why am I surprised?"
<br><br>

Bailey nods behind <<person1>><<him>>. The two of you walk towards the town as Gwylan waves you off. "We've a place prepared," <<he>> says.
<<if $litter_size is 1>>
<<elseif $litter_size is 2>>
	"For both of them."
<<else>>
	"For all three of them."
<</if>>

<<He>> leads you to Nightingale Street, where <<his>> car waits. <<He>> holds open the passenger door for you, before climbing in the other side.
<br><br>
The engine comes to life.
<!-- Bailey may not know about all your pregnancies -->
<<set _knownPregnancyCount to knowsAboutPregnancyTotal("pc","Bailey","home")>>
<<if _knownPregnancyCount is 1>>
	"You're responsible for your offspring's care," <<he>> says. "If I have to intervene, it'll cost you an extra <span class="red">£100</span> a week.<<if $litter_size gte 2>> Each.<</if>>"
	<br><br>
	"They don't leave the nursery," <<he>> adds as <<he>> drives from the hospital car park. "Ever."
<<elseif _knownPregnancyCount lte 4>>
	"Remember that you're responsible for your offspring's care," <<he>> says. "If I have to intervene, it'll cost you an extra <span class="red">£100</span> a week.<<if $litter_size gte 2>> Each.<</if>>"
<<else>>
	"You're an irresponsible slut," <<he>> says. "Remember that if I have to intervene in the care of your offspring, it'll cost you an extra <span class="red">£100</span> a week.<<if $litter_size gte 2>> Each.<</if>>"
<</if>>
<<if $baileydefeatedchain gte 3>>
	You see <<him>> sneer, but only for a brief instant. "I'd rather not make someone else take care of your twerps, but if you keep being a difficult little shit, don't think you'll be allowed to see them again."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $litter_size is 1>>
	<<link [[Tell Bailey your baby's name|Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 8]]>><<endevent>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Just hold the baby tight|Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 8]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Tell Bailey your babies' names|Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 8]]>><<endevent>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Just hold your babies tight|Pregnancy Birth Forest Shop 8]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

